                        <p></p><h1>
	<a name=3D"Introduction">Introduction:</a></h1>
<p>
	DCML (DOTWconnect Markup Language) is an XML based interface providing the=
 access to information and ability manage reservations for the global produ=
ct range of Destinations of the world. DCML is able to access Destinations =
of the World=E2=80=99s proprietary reservation system DOTWconnect with over=
 25,000 negotiated rate properties and standard rates at over 10,000 proper=
ties. DCML standardizes the requests and responses to the different sources=
 in order to provide a coherent product with a single communication interfa=
ce.</p>
<p></p>
