Starting date of the rule. From this day forward until toDate (if present),=
 the specified charge will be applied for any cancellations or amendments. =
If this element is not present then the charge will be applied from the cur=
rent date until toDate. Date format is: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS</td>
