                        <p></p><h2>
	General Response</h2>
<p>
	V4 also allows multiple rates with the same meal plan to be returned for t=
he same roomTypeCode. The difference between them could be the cancellation=
 policy and/or price. This new feature allows the user to select the most s=
uitable combination between price and flexibility.</p>
<p>
	Another new feature introduces multiple bedding and occupancy combinations=
 that can suit variable passenger needs.</p>
<p>
	For example, a search for 2 adults + 1 children, could return multiple rat=
es like a rate for the child sharing the bed with the adults and a second r=
ate with an extra bed for the child.</p>
<p>
	&nbsp;</p>
