                        <p></p><h2>
	Scenario H6</h2>
<p>
	After selecting and blocking the desired Room Types the customer has the o=
ption of either saving this booking information or confirm it with DOTWconn=
ect.</p>
<p>
	By saving a booking the rooms which are blocked will be released back to o=
ur inventory and<strong> the system will hold only the booking information<=
/strong>. Later on, the customer can confirm this booking (by passing in th=
e bookitinerary request the reference number received in the savebooking re=
sponse) but DOTWconnect system will have to reprocess this request as per t=
he current rates and availability.</p>
