                        <p></p><h2>
	Get Booking Details</h2>
<h3>
	General Request</h3>
<p>
	This request is used to retrieve all the available details that belong to =
an already existing booking (<strong>saved</strong> - using the savebooking=
 method or <strong>confirmed</strong> using confirmbooking/bookitinerary me=
thods). This method can be used for all DOTW services but the response migh=
t vary from service to service.</p>
