                        <p></p><h2>
	Cancel Booking</h2>
<p>
	The following request can be used to cancel a booking (booking code) that =
is confirmed or delete a booking that is saved.</p>
<p>
	Please note that this method is a two steps process:</p>
<p>
	<strong><span style=3D"font-weight:normal;"><strong>1.&lt;confirm&gt;no&lt=
;/confirm&gt;; 2.&lt;confirm&gt;yes&lt;/confirm&gt;.</strong></span></stron=
g></p>
<p>
	If you want to cancel an entire itinerary using the cancelBooking method y=
ou have to send separate cancelbooking requests for each of the booking cod=
es in your itinerary.</p>
<h3>
	General Request</h3>
