                        <p>Based on the search criteria provided in the XML=
 request, this method returns the (mandatory) additional services provided =
by the hotel for a specific period. When additional services are returned, =
the charges applicable for these services are always included in the total =
payable price for that particular room.
In addition to the Authentication data the elements required to be passed f=
or this method are defined in the following table.=20
