	    	        <div class=3D"page-header">
    <h4></h4>
</div>


                        <p>The requests for this command must have the prod=
uct element present. Its value will see for what service the servicing citi=
es will be returned. Possible values for the value of product element: hote=
l, apartment.

These command are used to get a complete list with all informaton needed ab=
out the cities in the system that have at least one hotel/apartment availab=
le in the future.

</p><h3>Genreal Request</h3>

The <b>topDeals</b>, <b>luxury</b>, <b>specialDeals</b> siblings of <b>filt=
ers</b> element is to be present only when product value is hotel.<p></p>
