    <h4></h4>
</div>


                        <p></p><p>
	The requests for this command must have the product element present. Its v=
alue will see for what service the servicing countries will be returned. Po=
ssible values for the value of product element: <i>hotel.</i> This commands=
 is used to get a complete list with all informaton needed about the countr=
ies in the system that have at least one hotel/apartment available in the f=
uture.</p>
<h3>
	General Request</h3>
<p>
	The <b>topDeals</b>, <b>luxury</b>, <b>specialDeals</b> siblings of <b>fil=
ters</b> element is to be present only when product value is hotel.</p>
<p></p>
